\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. In memory of the Saviour's love
\par We keep the sacred feast,
\par Where every humble, contrite heart
\par Is made a welcome guest.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. By faith we take the bread of life
\par With which our souls are fed,
\par The cup in token of His blood
\par That was for sinners shed.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Under His banner thus we sing
\par The wonders of His love,
\par And thus anticipate by faith
\par The heavenly feast above.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

